                                "sense_id": "3ea4e201-f736-380a-8fd3-d85a53b55d38",
                                "text": "[…] made by Wosnick several decades ago, that the name M. Silanus Murena is the result of a lapicide's error and that this part of the inscription was […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "306d9463-0aa4-4aea-bbe1-256eeb271bed",
                                "sense_id": "3ea4e201-f736-380a-8fd3-d85a53b55d38",
                                "text": "One or two cracks in the rock have been avoided by the lapicide."
